        <div class="rd-eyebrow">Coaching &amp; Supervision</div>
        <h1 class="rd-h2">Costs</h1>
        <p class="kst-lead">The costs depend on who commissions the coaching or supervision: you as a private individual, or an organization.</p>

        <div class="kst-cards">
          <article class="kst-card kst-navy">
            <div class="kst-eb">For private individuals</div>
            <h3>If you are paying yourself</h3>
            <div class="kst-price"><strong>150 €</strong><span>Rate per 60 minutes</span></div>
            <div class="kst-eb">Other common session lengths</div>
            <ul class="kst-rows">
              <li><span>90 minutes</span><b>225 €</b></li>
              <li><span>120 minutes</span><b>300 €</b></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="kst-p kst-p-s">Other session lengths are charged pro rata.</p>
            <div class="kst-fields">
              <div class="kst-field"><strong>Individuals</strong><span>Sessions from 60 minutes</span><span>Longer sessions can be arranged on request.</span></div>
              <div class="kst-field"><strong>Two or more people</strong><span>Sessions from 90 minutes</span><span>Longer sessions can be arranged on request.</span></div>
            </div>
            <ul class="kst-dots">
              <li>Individual coaching</li>
              <li>Individual supervision</li>
              <li>Group supervision</li>
              <li>Couples coaching</li>
              <li>Parent coaching</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="kst-note">Currently, no VAT is charged (§ 19 UStG).</div>
            <div class="kst-card-first">
              <div class="kst-eb">Initial contact · free of charge</div>
              <p class="kst-first-lead">You are welcome to start with a free, no-obligation initial contact by phone or online by video.</p>
              <p class="kst-first-p">The initial contact takes about 20 minutes. The first session that follows is a regular session, charged at the usual rate.</p>
