        <div class="kst-qa">
          <h2 class="kst-qh">Questions about costs and process</h2>
          <div class="kst-acc">
  <div class="kst-acc-item is-open">
    <button class="kst-acc-q" aria-expanded="true"><span class="kst-acc-t">Is everything we discuss kept confidential, even if my organization pays?</span><span class="faq-toggle"></span></button>
    <div class="kst-acc-a"><div class="kst-acc-a-inner"><p>For supervision or coaching of employees, we agree on the goals together with the participants or the person being coached and, where applicable, with the managers responsible.</p><p>As a rule, what is discussed in the sessions stays confidential. When we clarify the assignment, everyone involved agrees transparently on what information is passed on to management or the HR department, and in what form.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="kst-acc-item">
    <button class="kst-acc-q" aria-expanded="false"><span class="kst-acc-t">Can my employer cover the costs?</span><span class="faq-toggle"></span></button>
    <div class="kst-acc-a"><div class="kst-acc-a-inner"><p>Many employers fund coaching or supervision as part of staff development. Feel free to approach your manager or the HR department. If your employer covers the costs, the terms for organizations apply, and I agree the details directly with those responsible.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="kst-acc-item">
    <button class="kst-acc-q" aria-expanded="false"><span class="kst-acc-t">Do I have to pay if I cancel an appointment?</span><span class="faq-toggle"></span></button>
    <div class="kst-acc-a"><div class="kst-acc-a-inner"><p>You can cancel free of charge up to 48 hours before the agreed appointment. If you cancel later, I charge the full fee, since the slot can rarely be filled at short notice. If I manage to rebook it, there is no charge.</p><p>For organizations, different cancellation rules may apply. We agree on these in the offer.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="kst-acc-item">
    <button class="kst-acc-q" aria-expanded="false"><span class="kst-acc-t">How and when do I receive the invoice?</span><span class="faq-toggle"></span></button>
    <div class="kst-acc-a"><div class="kst-acc-a-inner"><p>You receive the invoice for the agreed sessions by the end of each month. For organizations, the payment terms agreed in the offer apply.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</div>
